  "id": "self-rating-scale",
  "term": "self-rating scale",
  "definition": "A self-rating scale is a self-report questionnaire in which people rate their own symptoms or difficulties. In this context, it is used to assess mental health problems by comparing questionnaire scores with a clinical interview standard.",
